WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
- Well, I don't trust Redwing.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.350
 Hold on a minute.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.130
 You don't have
to trust Redwing,

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.020
but I'm going to go
see if he's right.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.310
I have a feeling it might
be a part of the Big Three.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.390
 What Big Three?

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:12.360
 The Big Three.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.160
 What Big Three?

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.690
 Androids, aliens, and wizards.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:16.550
 That's not a thing.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.483
 That's definitely a thing.

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:18.320
 No, it's not.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.270
 Every time we fight, we
fight one of the three.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.250
 So who are you
fighting now, Gandalf?

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.480
 How do you know about Gandalf?

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:27.300
 I read The Hobbit in 1937
when it first came out.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.100
 So, you see my point.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:28.900
 No.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:29.900
I don't.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:30.930
There are no wizards.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.730
 Doctor Strange--

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.290
 --is a sorcerer.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:34.190
 Ha, ha.

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:37.820
A sorcerer is a
wizard without a hat.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.020
Think about it, right?

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:39.820
I'm right.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:40.953
I just-- I just
came up with that.

00:00:40.953 --> 00:00:41.753
It's crazy.

00:00:41.753 --> 00:00:42.840
But look that's not the point.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.570
These guys aren't
magic, all right?

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.310
They use brute force
just like you--

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.380
the incredibly annoying
guy in front of me

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.350
with the staring problem.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:50.150
 I'm coming with you.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.000
 No, you're not.

